OL,3,GNEWSALack of rehabilitation at
OL,4,A'high-risk' jail - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison which struggles with violence,
OL,7,Fself-harm and drugs is providing
OL,8,Flimited opportunities for the
OL,9,Frehabilitation and resettlement of its
OL,10,Finmates, a report has said.
OL,12,FHMP Winchester in Hampshire is also
OL,13,Fseriously affected by staffing
OL,14,Fshortages, the Independent Monitoring
OL,15,FBoard (IMB) found.
OL,17,FIMB Winchester chair Cord Oestmann said
OL,18,Fthe jail faced "constant pressures of
OL,19,Faccommodating and caring for a complex
OL,20,Fpopulation" in an "overcrowded, ageing
OL,21,Festate, parts of which are no longer
OL,22,Ffit for purpose".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
